# jemdoc: menu{menu.jemdoc}{projects.html}, title{Lab Projects}, notime

= Current

- *2024--2026* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Next-generation wireless networks with
  semantic communication" (Nafosted 102.04-2023.50). Budget: 826 million VND.

- *2024--2025* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Machine-learning-based semantic communication
  models for resource allocation and security improvement in IoT networks"
  (VNU-HCM DS2024-28-01). Budget: 700 million VND.

= Completed

- *2020--2023* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Applying a distributed training model
  for resource allocation in edge caching networks" (VNU-HCM DS2020-28-01).
  Budget: 500 million VND.

- *2016--2018* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Resource management optimisation in
  cache-enabled mobile networks" (Nafosted 102.02-2015.36). Budget: 460 million VND.

- *2015--2016* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Optimising content placement in caching
  networks supporting adaptive bit-rate streaming" (VNU-HCM C2015-28-01).
  Budget: 50 million VND.

- *2013--2015* \M *Key member*, "Performance improvement of multipath TCP congestion
  control algorithms" (Nafosted 102.02-2013.48). Budget: 584 million VND.

- *2008--2009* \M *Principal Investigator*, "Building network laboratories on Cisco
  equipment," a World Bank school-level grant. Budget: 20 million VND.

= Funding bodies

- *Nafosted* -- the National Foundation for Science and Technology Development of
  Vietnam, which funds basic research through competitive national calls.
- *VNU-HCM* -- Vietnam National University Ho Chi Minh City, which funds
  university-level projects and the DS programme for key research groups.
